r\nCorrectly emits `folding_changed` signal any time the `folded` property changes.\r\n\r\nThe current behaviour has many cases where the `folding_changed` signal is not emitted, despite the documentation describing it as \"Emitted when the container is folded/expanded.\"\r\n- Any folding state change from `FoldableGroup` does not emit the signal, as described in the linked issue.\r\n- Any modification to the `folded` property does not emit the signal either.\r\n\r\nClicks to the title bar always emits the signal, regardless if `folded` has changed. As well as calls to `fold()` and `expand()`. \r\n\r\n\r\nIf this is intentional behaviour I'd like clarification on the reasoning, as it causes a lot of unexpected behaviour when using this container.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/follow